Project Testing Phase – PocketSmart AI

The Project Testing Phase is carried out to check whether PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant works correctly and meets all the requirements. The system is tested to identify errors, improve performance, and ensure a smooth user experience.

Testing Activities

1. Login Testing – Check whether users can register and log in correctly.


2. Income Testing – Verify that income can be added, edited, and stored correctly.


3. Expense Testing – Check whether expenses are recorded and categorized accurately.


4. Budget Testing – Verify that monthly and category-wise budgets work correctly.


5. Recommendation Testing – Check whether the system provides relevant recommendations based on the user's spending and budget.


6. Alert Testing – Verify that users receive alerts when they approach or exceed their budget.


7. Database Testing – Ensure that user, income, expense, and budget data are stored and retrieved correctly.


8. Report Testing – Check whether spending reports and calculations are accurate.


9. Security Testing – Ensure that user information and financial data are protected.


10. User Interface Testing – Check whether all pages, buttons, menus, and features work properly and are easy to use.



Expected Result

After successful testing, errors and bugs are identified and corrected. The final PocketSmart AI system should be accurate, secure, reliable, user-friendly, and capable of providing useful budget and financial recommendations.
